OL,3,GNEWSAMore funding secured for Newstead
OL,4,AAbbey repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrants of more than #1.6m have been
OL,7,Fsecured to help fund urgent repairs at
OL,8,FNewstead Abbey.
OL,10,FThe site, which is owned by Nottingham
OL,11,FCity Council and was the former home of
OL,12,Fpoet Lord Byron, has been on Historic
OL,13,FEngland's Heritage at Risk Register
OL,14,Fsince 2004.
OL,16,FThe project has now secured a further
OL,17,Ffunding boost, with grants of #1.55m
OL,18,Ffrom the Arts Council England Museum
OL,19,FEstate and Development Fund and #66,114
OL,20,Ffrom the Historic Houses Foundation.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
