OL,3,GNEWSAMore funding secured for Newstead
OL,4,AAbbey repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham City Council is expected to
OL,7,Faccept the second phase funding and
OL,8,Frepairs plan at an executive board
OL,9,Fmeeting on 22 September, reports the
OL,10,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
